homelab-block-link (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The public pages at blockemail.<domain> (the "manage blocked addresses"
    form a link in a delivered email opens, and its "invalid link" and
    "link expired" pages) now have the same look as the rest of
    mailmasker: the shared top bar, footer and stylesheet from
    homelab-webtheme. They are templates now (templates/) instead of HTML
    built inside the controller. Same form, same fields, same Save call.
  * Save no longer sits at "Saving..." forever when the server cannot be
    reached, and the button is disabled while a save is in flight.
  * GET / redirects to https://mailmasker.org/ (web_theme.home_url), so
    the logo in the top bar leads somewhere instead of to a 404.
  * Depends on homelab-webtheme.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 10:01:16 -0600

