homelab-block-link (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix GET/POST /l/:token: block_link.pending_links.candidates is a
    JSONB column and comes back from Mojo::Pg as raw JSON text, not an
    inflated arrayref -- both handlers dereferenced it directly and
    500'd on every real request. Found on first live end-to-end test.

